    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1150-a6">

                <pb facs="1228" n="1132" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1132"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram, cipher.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Venezuela</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Caracas, via Haiti</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May 15,
                                1898</hi></date>. (Received 15, 5.45 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>The consul at Curacao telegraphs <hi rendition="#italic">Vizcaya</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">María Teresa</hi> are coaling. * * * Nothing known yet
                    of movements. Cable later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
